        "emoji": "🌤️",
        "hindi": "मौसम",
        "hinglish": "mausam"
      },
      "meaning": "how hot, cold, wet or windy it is outside",
      "example": "The weather is cool today.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "आज मौसम ठंडा है।",
        "hinglish": "Aaj mausam thanda hai."
      }
    },
