      },
      "meaning": "a part of the year like summer or winter",
      "example": "Winter is my favourite season.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "सर्दी मेरी सबसे पसंदीदा ऋतु है।",
        "hinglish": "Sardi meri sabse pasandeeda ritu hai."
      }
    },
